===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# An [[agent]] sent on a [[mission]] to [[represent]] the [[interests]] of someone else.
# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A [[venous]] [[channel]] in the [[skull]].
# An [[underground]] channel by which the [[water]] of a [[lake]] [[escape]]s.

